WEBVTT

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:17.300
As of today, as chairman
of the Kengan Association...

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.850
KENGAN LIFE-OR-DEATH

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:26.940
...I hereby declare the Kengan
Life-or-Death Tournament open.

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.730
METSUDO KATAHARA
GOVERNOR OF DAINIPPON BANK

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:34.990
Anyone who desires the position
of chairman of the association is welcome.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.490
Enter your strongest fighter!

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.660
<i>This declaration by Metsudo Katahara,</i>
<i>the chairman of the Kengan Association,</i>

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.290
<i>was earth-shattering</i>
<i>to those who desired power.</i>

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:51.960
FIGHTERS WRIGGLE IN THE DARK!

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:27.020
REUNITED

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:31.440
NOGI GROUP HEADQUARTERS

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:32.770
<i>Oh no! Oh no!</i>

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:34.270
KAZUO YAMASHITA
NOGI PUBLICATIONS

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:38.030
Ohma, what are you doing to Mr. Nogi?

00:02:38.490 --> 00:02:42.070
Old man. What did you just say?

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.530
HIDEKI NOGI
CHAIRMAN, NOGI GROUP

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:46.660
I'll say it as many times as you want,
Ohma Tokita.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.460
For the next Kengan
Life-or-Death Tournament,

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:54.800
I won't have you fight
on behalf of our company.

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:58.760
I guess you want me
to end your life here, huh?

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:02.430
Hold on a second.
Please, calm down a little.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:04.640
KAEDE AKIYAMA,
CHAIRMAN'S SECRETARY, NOGI GROUP

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:06.100
<i>What has changed Mr. Nogi's mind?</i>

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.520
<i>He tested Ohma's abilities</i>
<i>in previous kengan matches</i>

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:12.850
<i>to be sure he was good</i>
<i>enough to fight for us.</i>

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:15.480
Oh?

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:17.780
Are you in the middle of something?

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:19.240
It's you!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:22.410
Tokita, let me introduce you.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:25.740
This is Sen Hatsumi,

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:30.290
Nogi Group's chosen fighter
for the Kengan Life-or-Death Tournament.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.330
SEN HATSUMI
FIGHTER, NOGI GROUP

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.130
Hey, reject. Good to meet you.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.300
He's going to represent us?

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:41.970
This is a disgraceful sight, Pop.
Are you in trouble?

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:45.890
Can't you see? Just help me, you idiot.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.560
You heard him.

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:51.390
Mind if I resort to violence, reject?

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:56.190
Do you think that would work against me?

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:58.280
Yes, I do.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:09.040
You shouldn't raise
your hand to your employer.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:11.290
Actually, before that,

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.290
you should take
better care of your broken arm.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.590
What are you, a doctor?

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.800
Not just your right arm, your whole body.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:24.300
All that damage you've taken
is pretty serious.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:27.640
You think you can fight in that condition?

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:29.510
Dream on, brat.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:33.640
<i>He's dodging all Ohma's blows.</i>

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.350
He has 39 wins and 15 losses.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:42.320
That's Sen Hatsumi's kengan match record.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:45.110
Fifteen losses? Isn't that kind of a lot?

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:48.830
There's no doubt that
his skills are first-rate,

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:51.080
but he has some behavioral problems.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.620
His loss breakdown is--

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:57.000
I skipped four, forgot about two,
and missed nine because I overslept.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.290
That adds up to 15 losses.

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:02.090
-Hey!
-You've made me happy, Kaede.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.880
I didn't know you cared
about me that much.

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:07.760
Do you have any idea
how much those losses cost Nogi Group?

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:10.390
Do you want to go out
for dinner with me later?

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:11.770
No, I don't!

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:18.020
Oops. Did I go too far?

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.980
Seems like I flicked a switch in him.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:27.610
<i>That sound is exactly the same as the one</i>
<i>I heard in the match with Sekibayashi.</i>

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:32.200
Okay, you started this.
No hard feelings, even if you die.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:43.590
You blocked me. Your speed has greatly
increased since you changed to that form.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:46.680
What's the trick?
Some kind of transformation?

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:50.850
Whatever.
I'm pretty confident about my speed, too.

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:55.180
Do you want to see
if you're faster than me?

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:03.070
<i>He really is fast. But...</i>

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.120
You bent the flow of my power.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.170
You use the Niko Style, don't you?

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:22.210
Did you say Niko Style?

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.460
That's strange.

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:28.720
I heard the Niko Style wasn't passed
down to the second generation.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:35.140
Don't you ever talk about Niko again!

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.770
Oh. Did that hit a nerve?

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:42.900
You're far too cocky, you little brat.

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:44.400
That's enough.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:45.400
Oh, God!

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:47.030
Ohma.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:49.110
This is not open to discussion.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:53.990
Sen Hatsumi will represent
Nogi Group at the tournament.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.750
Yeah? Will he?

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:00.750
-Then, I'll kill--
-However...

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:06.800
there's nothing stopping you winning
a spot in the tournament yourself.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:09.170
What?

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:13.550
Don't you understand?

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:18.520
You'll need a certain individual
to make this plan work, though.

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:22.940
-Yamashita, come here.
-Me? Yes, sir.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:29.190
Why don't you become a member
of the Kengan Association?

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:38.500
What are you talking about, Mr. Nogi?

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:41.250
There's no way he can become a member.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:44.290
You still have a lot to learn, Akiyama.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:47.750
There are always loopholes
to be found in business.

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:51.420
Being a member of the Kengan Association

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.970
confirms that you are
a first-rate merchant.

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:59.350
<i>This is the reason countless people</i>
<i>are dying to become members.</i>

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:00.520
FIST

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:04.440
<i>There are also people who pretend to have</i>
<i>the authority of the Kengan Association</i>

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:08.650
<i>and conduct unofficial matches</i>
<i>offering the chance to win membership.</i>

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:12.400
<i>What they want is money,</i>
<i>paid as a "challenge fee."</i>

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:14.110
Unofficial matches?

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:18.410
The referees are from
the official Kengan Association.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:22.790
I guess you could call them
"kengan challenge matches."

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:26.580
The challenge fee is
a hundred million yen.

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:30.010
-A hundred--
-Don't worry.

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:33.170
I happen to have that
exact amount to hand today.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.220
Here. A hundred million yen.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:37.680
How do you have that?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.060
What do you say, Yamashita?

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:44.520
This is the only way Ohma
can fight in the tournament.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:48.400
<i>Wait. Why am I being forced to make</i>
<i>such a crazy decision?</i>

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:51.030
<i>How did this happen?</i>
<i>This whole situation is messed up.</i>

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:55.320
<i>I'm just an ordinary businessman.</i>
<i>How could I do such a thing?</i>

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:59.530
<i>I need to calm down. Take a deep breath.</i>

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:04.540
<i>I need to stand my ground</i>
<i>and say no without offending him.</i>

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:10.050
Well, I appreciate your offer, but...

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:15.800
Cool. We'll enter
these unofficial matches.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:19.300
Why are you answering for me?

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:23.310
Hey. I'm going to settle things
between us at the tournament.

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:25.560
All right. Whatever you say.

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:28.560
<i>Don't they understand that</i>
<i>I haven't agreed yet?</i>

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:31.690
-Great decision.
-I admire your courage.

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.820
<i>Why are they taking this as a yes from me?</i>

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:39.070
<i>This is bad. I have to get out</i>
<i>of this before it's too late.</i>

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:43.870
Listen to me, Ohma.
I'm sorry to tell you this, but...

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:46.870
Let's do this, Kazuo Yamashita.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.460
<i>Yes. Let's do our best.</i>

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:55.550
<i>It's been officially confirmed.</i>

00:09:55.800 --> 00:10:00.800
<i>Kazuo Yamashita will enter</i>
<i>the unofficial kengan match.</i>

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:10.940
UNDERGROUND DISCHARGE TUNNEL
(40 METERS BELOW GROUND)

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:13.900
<i>This is the metropolitan area outer</i>
<i>underground discharge tunnel.</i>

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:17.400
<i>Tonight, fighters will get a chance to</i>
<i>win membership of the Kengan Association,</i>

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:22.280
<i>by taking part in unofficial fights.</i>

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:25.540
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,</i>

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:31.460
<i>thank you for coming</i>
<i>all the way down here to join us tonight.</i>

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:41.050
Let me now introduce the fighters.

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:46.930
This fighter holds membership
of the Kengan Association.

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:50.560
Ushitami Food Service's
affiliated fighter...

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:54.070
MASAYASU YOKOTA
FIGHTER, USHITAMI FOOD SERVICE

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:55.400
...Masayasu Yokota.

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:59.820
The challenger is Yamashita Corporation's
affiliated fighter,

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.660
Ohma Tokita.

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:04.080
OHMA TOKITA
FIGHTER, YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.870
-Isn't that guy with Nogi?
-He knocked Sekibayashi down.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:10.960
-He's the rookie everyone's talking about.
-Has he transferred already?

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:13.250
KAZUO YAMASHITA
PRESIDENT, YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:15.670
-Yamashita Corporation?
-Their president looks really pale.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:19.050
<i>How did I get myself into this?</i>

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.180
A company?

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:23.430
Yes, your company.

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:28.060
The Kengan Association is an organization
of business managers and finance people.

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:30.230
So, to become a member of the association,

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:33.940
you need to be a company manager,
it's just a formality.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:38.440
The name of the company
and its line of work don't really matter.

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:41.700
How about a simple name,
such as "Yamashita Corporation"?

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:45.070
<i>He's making bad life decisions</i>
<i>on my behalf.</i>

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:48.620
All that's left to do now
is to apply for the match.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:55.790
The next matches will be held
in two days, eight days and 12 days’ time.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.550
<i>There's no going back now.</i>

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:03.760
<i>So, the date. Which one would be better?</i>

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:06.510
-I'll fight in two days, obviously.
-Huh?

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:08.430
Hold on, Ohma.

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:11.270
-You can't fight with your wounded--
-Kazuo Yamashita.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:14.480
Do you think they will have healed
in ten days or even in 12?

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.900
Well, you have a point, but...

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:20.940
I'm going to be fit by the time
the Life-or-Death Tournament is held,

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:22.700
totally fit, for sure.

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:26.620
I will make it to the tournament.

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:29.620
And that's where I will beat you.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.790
All right. We've confirmed that
you've paid the fee.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.210
We wish you luck.

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:41.590
<i>I'll be one hundred million yen in debt</i>
<i>whether we win or not.</i>

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.720
MIKIO NABE
PRESIDENT, USHITAMI FOOD SERVICE

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:47.300
Yokota, you're known as
the "Kingpin Brawler of Gadokan Karate."

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.060
-I bet you'll finish him in no time.
-Sure.

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:56.060
Kengan membership is such a great way
to attract rich suckers.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:59.570
I love making money.

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:02.570
Are you ready? Set!

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:09.950
Fight!

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:14.580
Huh?

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:24.510
The winner is Ohma Tokita!

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:30.810
<i>We've lost our membership</i>
<i>of the Kengan Association.</i>

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:36.850
-Kazuo Yamashita.
-Yes?

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:38.860
We won.

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:42.980
That's... awesome!

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:48.700
<i>I can trust this man with my life.</i>

00:13:56.830 --> 00:14:01.380
<i>Is this the membership certificate?</i>
<i>It's very plain.</i>

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.550
<i>What's important is its value.</i>

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.720
Why?

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:07.630
Why is he there?

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:14.180
I didn't expect to see
him again like this.

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:17.310
How many years has it been...

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:19.060
KENZO YAMASHITA
KAZUO'S OLDEST SON

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:20.520
...since I last saw his face?

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:23.820
You look a lot older, Dad.

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:29.700
UNDER MOUNT INC

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:34.120
MASAHIKO OHTA
PRESIDENT, UNDER MOUNT INC

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:35.720
Hello?

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:41.290
Oh! Hello, boss. How are you, sir?

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:45.460
<i>Mr. Ohta, I've told you so many times</i>
<i>that you're the one who's president.</i>

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:48.050
KENZO'S ROOM IN YAMASHITA'S HOUSE
USED AS UNDER MOUNT INC HQ

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:51.050
-I'm happy hiding behind you.
<i>-Well, you may think that way,</i>

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:54.180
<i>but if it hadn't been for you,</i>
<i>the company couldn't have come this far.</i>

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:57.390
<i>You're the one working behind the scenes.</i>

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:59.730
Putting that aside,

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:03.520
thank you for recording the match
the other day.

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:05.610
No problem at all.

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:09.650
<i>With a certain unexpected discovery,</i>
<i>we've now collected enough data.</i>

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:13.240
-Does that mean...
<i>-Yes.</i>

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:18.620
We will enter
the Kengan Life-or-Death Tournament

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:24.250
after welcoming one fighter
from the Kure Family.

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:28.300
<i>Kure?</i>

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:29.510
KURE FAMILY

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:31.300
<i>What is the Kure Family?</i>

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:36.100
<i>They appear wherever</i>
<i>conflict is happening.</i>

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:38.470
<i>Providing the money</i>
<i>and conditions are right,</i>

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:40.980
<i>they won't hesitate to kill</i>
<i>their previous employers.</i>

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:44.150
<i>They are, so to speak, mercenaries.</i>

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:51.030
We have decided to fight for
Under Mount Inc in the tournament.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:56.530
I wonder which member of our family
we should send to the tournament?

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:13.800
<i>I don't need to step out of this house.</i>

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:16.180
<i>I can stay in the shadows...</i>

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:20.180
<i>and seize this country.</i>

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:26.310
<i>Hey, Kazu! It's me, Ken.</i>

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:30.360
<i>Are you free now?</i>
<i>Let's go for a drink together.</i>

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:32.950
<i>-See you soon, Kazu.</i>
<i>-Wait.</i>

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:36.950
<i>That drunk man at the match called me.</i>

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:39.040
<i>As I couldn't turn it down,</i>
<i>I found myself here.</i>

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:42.080
<i>But what kind of man drinks</i>
<i>at this high-class hotel?</i>

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:43.250
FIVE STAR HOTEL, TOKYO

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.540
Whatever it was that brought us together,

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:51.840
I wanted to give you a pep talk,
now that we're friends.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.510
Friends? A pep talk?

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:58.550
I'm surprised you've become
a member of the Kengan Association.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:00.010
How did you find out about that?

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:02.020
The whole Kengan Association
is talking about it.

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:03.680
SKY BAR LOUNGE,
UPPER FLOOR OF THE HOTEL

00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:05.440
They're saying that
some mysterious company

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:08.360
called the Yamashita Corporation
is going to join the kengan tournament.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:09.690
Are they?

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:12.440
So, did Mr. Nogi pay
the entry fee of five billion yen

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:14.740
for you to pay back later?

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:18.200
Five... what?

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:21.040
He set me up!

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:24.540
He didn't say anything about that.

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:29.000
You can pay it off
easily enough if you win.

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:30.750
That son of a bitch.

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:33.340
-Damn it!
-Wow.

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:37.680
I'll do it. I just need to win, right?

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:42.850
I will make that Nogi bastard
regret the day he underestimated me!

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:45.940
Wow. Look at you, Kazu.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.900
I've made up my mind.

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:52.570
From now on,
as the president of Yamashita Corporation,

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:54.740
I'll handle the Kengan
Life-or-Death Tournament.

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:58.860
Kazuo Yamashita of Nogi Publications
dies today!

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.240
That's the spirit!

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:02.700
Screw the Nogi Group!

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:10.840
There's something I wanted to
tell you tonight, Kazu.

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:14.260
What is it, Ken?

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:19.300
My company is actually participating in
the Kengan Life-or-Death Tournament too.

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:21.550
-Right?
-Yes.

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:25.180
This is our fighter, Ryo Himuro.

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.440
RYO HIMURO
FIGHTER, GINOKUNIYA BOOKSHOP

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:32.320
He's only fought four kengan matches
but he's a really good fighter.

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:37.150
Really?
And which company are you talking about?

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:40.280
It's a little bookstore called Ginokuniya.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:44.540
You named it after
the famous Ginokuniya Bookshop?

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:47.500
We are the Ginokuniya.

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:51.540
-You are?
-We are.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:52.790
Oh.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:57.130
You're like the famous shogun
who patrolled the city in disguise.

00:18:57.260 --> 00:19:00.300
Oh, Kazu. That's very flattering.

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:02.260
KEN OHYA
CHAIRMAN, GINOKUNIYA BOOKSHOP

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:04.890
I hate to say this to you,
but the championship will be ours.

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:10.390
That's funny.
Somehow I feel like I saw this coming.

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:12.940
I'm not going to lose, Ken.

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.860
That's just what I want, Kazu.

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:23.910
ABANDONED MINE, TOKYO

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:44.680
<i>Good. I've completely recovered.</i>

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:46.760
<i>All I need to do is win.</i>

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:49.430
<i>I've arrived...</i>

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:52.400
<i>on the battlefield.</i>

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:02.240
<i>These last ten years have felt</i>
<i>like a long time.</i>

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:04.200
NIKO TOKITA
OHMA'S MASTER OF NIKO STYLE

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:05.410
<i>A very long time.</i>

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.160
<i>Niko.</i>

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:15.880
Hi. Long time no see.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:18.670
Huh?

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:20.880
Who the hell are you?

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.800
GENZAN TAIRA
NIKO'S ENEMY, KOEI STYLE

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:32.480
-Now you remember me.
-What are you doing here?

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:34.270
<i>I let him get close.</i>

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:36.940
Oh, I love it.

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:40.860
You've beefed up beautifully
since I last saw you.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:42.070
You--

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:45.820
I have one thing to tell you.

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:47.780
You've been chasing...

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:51.120
my master for the past ten years
in order to get your revenge.

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:54.290
But I killed him.

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:57.750
How does it feel?

00:20:58.130 --> 00:21:01.510
The man who killed your master,
Niko Tokita,

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:04.220
is already dead.

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:06.760
You must be so mad.

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:10.010
Take it all out on me,
the man who stole your revenge.

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:13.180
Come on. Don't be shy.

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:16.810
Go ahead and kill me
just like my master killed Niko Tokita.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:20.650
<i>I'll see you again someday.</i>

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:25.110
<i>I hope the next time</i>
<i>we see each other...</i>

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:29.830
<i>we'll be enemies.</i>

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:33.540
<i>Niko.</i>

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:37.580
Now, strike me with your anger.

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:40.630
The man who ruined your revenge
is right in front of you.

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:42.760
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:45.470
What did you say?

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:49.680
Revenge?
Did you think that's what I wanted?

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:53.930
Your master and Niko only died
because they were weak.

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:56.480
But I am stronger than Niko was.

00:21:57.100 --> 00:22:01.690
The reason I was going after
your master was to prove that.

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:08.200
I can't stand those fools who act like
they're the strongest of all of us.

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:11.700
I'm going to crush
every one of those bastards...

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:15.500
and show them that I'm the strongest!

00:22:16.250 --> 00:22:18.710
Luckily, there's a stage set up

00:22:18.830 --> 00:22:22.130
for misguided dudes
who think they're the strongest.

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:25.590
I'm going to smash you
at that tournament,

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:29.180
along with all of those other
self-proclaimed "strongest" fighters.

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:33.060
Look forward to it, you freak.

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:41.610
You're right. You're right!

00:22:41.730 --> 00:22:44.360
We should choose the best possible stage
on which to kill each other.

00:22:44.440 --> 00:22:49.910
Seek for love, fight for love,
and kill each other for love.

00:22:51.740 --> 00:22:55.910
And then, in despair of losing you,

00:22:56.040 --> 00:22:58.750
I will shoot my load.

00:22:59.250 --> 00:23:01.380
Man, you're too much to handle.

00:23:01.790 --> 00:23:05.000
Now that we have a plan,
I should get going.

00:23:05.920 --> 00:23:08.260
I'll see you at the tournament.

00:23:09.130 --> 00:23:14.050
Tell me one thing before you go.
What's your name?

00:23:15.470 --> 00:23:16.640
Setsuna.

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:20.850
SETSUNA KIRYU
FIGHTER, KOUOU EDUCATION GROUP

00:23:21.060 --> 00:23:22.400
I'm Setsuna Kiryu. Don't forget.

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:25.900
It's the name of your enemy.

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:33.990
Setsuna Kiryu, huh?

00:23:39.710 --> 00:23:41.000
Got it.

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:50.970
Setsuna Kiryu!
I'm going to crush you!

00:23:53.010 --> 00:23:56.220
<i>With emotions running high,</i>

00:23:56.760 --> 00:24:03.020
<i>the Kengan Life-or-Death Tournament</i>
<i>is about to begin.</i>

00:25:36.200 --> 00:25:37.240
PREVIEW

00:25:37.360 --> 00:25:39.200
<i>Is it a wish? Or an ambition?</i>

00:25:39.530 --> 00:25:42.200
<i>The kengan fighters are</i>
<i>at the mercy of the ship of death.</i>

00:25:42.580 --> 00:25:45.580
<i>Show your powers.</i>
<i>Fight your own way.</i>

00:25:45.960 --> 00:25:48.380
<i>Absolutely no holding back</i>
<i>in this battle royal.</i>

00:25:48.540 --> 00:25:49.960
<i>Next episode: "Brawl"</i>

00:25:50.130 --> 00:25:51.840
Subtitle Translation by Miki Miyaji
